//--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
//                      S L R    A N A L Y Z E R    A C T I O N    T A B L E                        
//
//--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Action tables handle shift and reduce actions:
//  - a shift action is (terminal_symbol, SHIFT (n)): if shifts to state n;
